---
import shellUrl from "../_shared/game-shell.css?url";
import styleUrl from "./_assets/style.css?url";
import gameUrl from "./_assets/game.js?url";
---
<!doctype html><html lang="zh-CN"><head><meta charset="UTF-8"><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1"><title>星泡舞台 · 贝拉泡泡龙</title><link rel="stylesheet" href={styleUrl}><link rel="stylesheet" href={shellUrl}></head><body><main><header><div><p>BELLA KIRA · BUBBLE STAGE</p><h1>星泡舞台</h1><span>瞄准同色星泡，三颗相连即可消除。</span></div><button id="restart">重新开始</button></header><section><aside><div><small>分数</small><strong id="score">0</strong></div><div><small>下一颗</small><b id="next"></b></div><p>移动指针瞄准，点击发射。星泡可以从侧墙反弹，失去顶部连接的泡泡会一起掉落。</p></aside><div class="game"><canvas id="canvas" width="480" height="660"></canvas><div id="modal" hidden><h2 id="title"></h2><p id="summary"></p><button id="again">再玩一次</button></div></div></section></main><a class="site-return" href="/games/" aria-label="返回互动空间">← 互动空间</a><script is:inline src={gameUrl}></script></body></html>
